error[removed-field] machines.web.docker  (isoloom.yml:8:5)
  a machine says what it runs, never how a platform runs it, so `docker:` is gone
  fix: `app: { build: build/web }`; `init` → `setup: [...]`, and a flag script becomes `files: [{ path, input }]`
